{"articleNo":"378212","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=378212&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교외행사] 스마트팩토리 SW과정 국비 교육생 모집 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2022.06.20","hit":"6949","attachments":[{"name":"(렛유인)스마트팩토리 SW과정 5기 홍보 이미지(추가 모집).png","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=download&articleNo=378212&attachNo=113417"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/cms/plugin/editorImage.do?EwBmwehA2CFcCeAHAGgKwMYDMDyA5JAIwAkAbAWwFMsAhSgLQGsA6JAOwHMg%20\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"clear:none;float:none;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, dotum, AppleGothic, arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(98, 98, 98);\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">[스마트팩토리&nbsp;SW과정&nbsp;5기&nbsp;국비&nbsp;교육생 추가 모집&nbsp;안내]</span></b><br></p><div style=\"border: 0px; color: rgb(98, 98, 98); outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 9pt; line-height: 2; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, dotum, AppleGothic, arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 18pt;\">&nbsp;</span></div><div style=\"border: 0px; color: rgb(98, 98, 98); outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 9pt; line-height: 18px; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, dotum, AppleGothic, arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center;\"><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 9pt; line-height: 18px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"></span></div><p style=\"border: 0px; line-height: 2; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 14pt;\">1.&nbsp;대상</span><br><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 14pt;\">-&nbsp;이공계&nbsp;대졸&nbsp;취업&nbsp;예정자&nbsp;및&nbsp;졸업&nbsp;예정자</span><br><br><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 14pt;\">2.&nbsp;스마트팩토리&nbsp;SW과정&nbsp;특징</span><br><br><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 14pt;\">1)&nbsp;스마트팩토리에&nbsp;특화된&nbsp;국내&nbsp;유일의&nbsp;SAP&nbsp;ERP와&nbsp;MES&nbsp;통합&nbsp;실무교육과정</span><br><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 14pt;\">●&nbsp;SAP&nbsp;ERP-MES&nbsp;통합&nbsp;과정</span><br><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 14pt;\">●&nbsp;1,500만원&nbsp;상당의&nbsp;교육비&nbsp;전액&nbsp;지원</span><br><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 14pt;\">●&nbsp;280시간의&nbsp;프로젝트를&nbsp;통한&nbsp;실무&nbsp;경험</span><br><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 14pt;\">●&nbsp;취업&nbsp;추천&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;렛유인&nbsp;취업&nbsp;교육&nbsp;지원</span><br><br><br><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 14pt;\">2)&nbsp;교육생&nbsp;특별혜택</span><br><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 14pt;\">●&nbsp;과정&nbsp;수강료&nbsp;전액&nbsp;국비지원&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;교보재&nbsp;무료&nbsp;제공</span><br><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 14pt;\">●&nbsp;최대&nbsp;116,000원&nbsp;매달&nbsp;지급</span><br><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 14pt;\">●&nbsp;훈련생&nbsp;1인당&nbsp;SAP/MES&nbsp;실습환경&nbsp;1-SET&nbsp;제공</span><br><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 14pt;\">●&nbsp;협력&nbsp;기업&nbsp;취업&nbsp;추천&nbsp;(SAP&nbsp;직무&nbsp;희망시)</span><br><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 14pt;\">●&nbsp;렛유인&nbsp;자기소개서/면접&nbsp;컨설팅&nbsp;등&nbsp;취업&nbsp;교육&nbsp;제공</span><br><br><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 14pt;\">3.&nbsp;수강료&nbsp;</span><br><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 14pt;\">-&nbsp;전액&nbsp;무료&nbsp;(1,500만원&nbsp;상당의&nbsp;교육)</span><br><br><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 14pt;\">4.&nbsp;모집&nbsp;및&nbsp;훈련&nbsp;기간</span><br><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 14pt;\">-&nbsp;모집&nbsp;기간&nbsp;:&nbsp;2022.06.20~2022.06.30&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span><br><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 14pt;\">-&nbsp;신청&nbsp;방법:&nbsp;사이트에서&nbsp;신청&nbsp;양식&nbsp;다운로드하여&nbsp;작성후&nbsp;</span><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"http://dfc@suwon.ac.kr/\" style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(75, 75, 75);\"><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 14pt;\">dfc@suwon.ac.kr</span></a><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 14pt;\">로&nbsp;제출</span><br><br><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 14pt;\">-&nbsp;훈련&nbsp;기간&nbsp;:&nbsp;2022.07.18~2022.12.23(총&nbsp;880시간-하루&nbsp;8시간씩&nbsp;110일&nbsp;/&nbsp;토,일,공휴일,샌드위치&nbsp;데이&nbsp;휴강)</span><br><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 14pt;\">-훈련&nbsp;정원:&nbsp;20명</span><br><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 14pt;\">-훈련&nbsp;장소:&nbsp;수원대학교&nbsp;디지털제조센터</span><br><br><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 14pt;\">▶&nbsp;스마트팩토리&nbsp;SW과정&nbsp;신청하러가기</span>&nbsp;</p></div><p style=\"border: 0px; color: rgb(98, 98, 98); font-family: 나눔고딕, &quot;나눔 고딕&quot;, Nanum, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 13px; line-height: 2; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, dotum, AppleGothic, arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">☞&nbsp;</span><span style=\"border: 0px; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, dotum, AppleGothic, arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://bit.ly/3NQok3S\" style=\"font: inherit; border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(75, 75, 75);\"><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 14pt;\">https://bit.ly/3NQok3S</span></a>&nbsp;</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
